// alea, one feature at a time · 12 — Components
// Works inside works: a work with an output is a component; use brings it
// into another work, called by name like a circle; every call is a new draw;
// small works make bigger ones (the moons and waves on screen are the real
// components, 12-components/moon.alea and waves.alea, called by this program).
// Generated by series/gen.py from series/12-components.json; the template is the
// generator, the episode is the JSON.

use "12-components/moon.alea"
use "12-components/waves.alea"

